WEBVTT

00:03:59.402 --> 00:04:02.321
that came of age with relative freedom

00:04:02.363 --> 00:04:04.448
and was robbed of it overnight.

00:04:05.408 --> 00:04:06.575
Sumbul’s family

00:04:06.575 --> 00:04:09.704
come from one of the most
inaccessible regions of Afghanistan.

00:04:09.745 --> 00:04:13.040
Her father was kidnapped
several times by the Taliban,

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:15.876
being pressured to pull [his] daughters
out of music school.

00:04:16.794 --> 00:04:18.337
After the fall of Kabul,

00:04:18.379 --> 00:04:20.965
Taliban fighters raided and ANIM school.

00:04:20.965 --> 00:04:22.758
Instruments were destroyed.

00:04:22.758 --> 00:04:24.343
On August 26,

00:04:24.385 --> 00:04:27.346
Sumbul and her uncle
were outside of the airport

00:04:27.346 --> 00:04:30.683
among thousands of desperate
Afghans trying to flee